{
  "id": "E397",
  "title": "Drink More Water",
  "level": "newbie",
  "date": "2020-01-23",
  "synopsis": "Little Ming’s mother wants Little Ming to drink more water. Will he agree?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/50397/59cdce1e7180a6102f29b98b5f4e13a91cb8f928.mp3?1579527469",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "多喝水\n\n妈妈：多喝水对身体好。\n小明：但是水不好喝啊。\n妈妈：好喝的东西对身体不好。\n小明：啤酒很好喝，对身体也不好吗？\n妈妈：啊？你什么时候喝过啤酒？\n小明：我是听爷爷说的。\n",
    "traditional": "多喝水\n\n媽媽：多喝水對身體好。\n小明：但是水不好喝啊。\n媽媽：好喝的東西對身體不好。\n小明：啤酒很好喝，對身體也不好嗎？\n媽媽：啊？你什麼時候喝過啤酒？\n小明：我是聽爺爺說的。\n"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Drink More Water"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "妈妈：多喝水对身体好。",
      "traditional": "媽媽：多喝水對身體好。",
      "pinyin": "mā ma duō hē shuǐ duì shēn tǐ hǎo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Mom: It’s good for your health to drink more water."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小明：但是水不好喝啊。",
      "traditional": "小明：但是水不好喝啊。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng dàn shì shuǐ bù hǎo hē a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming: But water isn’t tasty."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "妈妈：好喝的东西对身体不好。",
      "traditional": "媽媽：好喝的東西對身體不好。",
      "pinyin": "mā ma hǎo hē de dōng xi duì shēn tǐ bù hǎo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Mom: Tasty things are not good for your health."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小明：啤酒很好喝，对身体也不好吗？",
      "traditional": "小明：啤酒很好喝，對身體也不好嗎？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng pí jiǔ hěn hǎo hē duì shēn tǐ yě bù hǎo ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming: Beer is very tasty, is that also bad for your health?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "妈妈：啊？你什么时候喝过啤酒？",
      "traditional": "媽媽：啊？你什麼時候喝過啤酒？",
      "pinyin": "mā ma a nǐ shén me shí hou hē guò pí jiǔ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Mom: Huh? When did you drink beer?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "小明：我是听爷爷说的。",
      "traditional": "小明：我是聽爺爺說的。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng wǒ shì tīng yé ye shuō de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming: I heard Grandpa say so."
    }
  ],
